r the tab icon. Pass one when creating.", "type": "string"}, "label": {"description": "Optional short version label.", "type": "string"}, "mode": {"description": "For a republish; leave it out when creating. patch (default): only the files named change. replace: the files named become the artifact's own files, and any other file of its own is removed. A file that comes from the artifact's type or from another artifact is not the artifact's own, and it stays when the call leaves it out.", "type": "string"}, "remove": {"description": "For a republish: served paths to delete, spelled as list_files gives them. A path the artifact does not hold is ignored without an error. To delete and change nothing else, give files as an empty list.", "items": {"type": "string"}, "maxItems": 256, "type": "array"}, "shared_live": {"description": "States who the artifact you are republishing is already shared with, and changes nothing: its 'read' value from get_artifact, read_artifact or your last publish result. Required when that value is 'users' (named people or groups), 'org' (the user's whole organization) or 'public' (anyone with the link). Leave it out for a new artifact and when the value is 'owner'. Rejected if it does not match the artifact's current value.", "type": "string"}, "slug": {"description": "The artifact's slug. Omit to create a new artifact.", "type": "string"}, "title": {"description": "Browser-tab title. Required when creating.", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["files"], "type": "object"}, "name": "mcp__claude-artifacts__publish_files"}, "server": "claude-artifacts"}, {"description": "Publish an artifact: either create a new artifact — omit slug and give title and content; you become its owner and it starts private to you — or publish a new version of an artifact you own, or of one in your organization that you can edit — give slug and base_version. Some clients may publish only to your own artifacts: there the call is refused as owner-only. Republishing is read